# No secrets currently required — weather_fetch uses the free Open-Meteo API.
# Optional runtime settings, e.g.:
#   TRAIN_FILTER="S, RE8"   # only S-Bahn and RE8 (see docs/src.md)
#
# Copied to ~/bahnhofstafel/.env on the Pi and sourced by start.sh, so extra
# daemons can read secrets from the environment.
